---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About KIPROD – Strengthening Credit Risk. Building Resilient Institutions."
  description="About KIPROD: an integrated institutional credit risk ecosystem focused on governance visibility, capability development, and operational strengthening."
  activePath="/about"
>
  <section class="hero" style="min-height: 56vh">
    <div class="hero-grid"></div>
    <div class="hero-glow" style="top: -260px; right: -220px"></div>
    <div class="hero-inner" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-bottom: 80px">
      <h1 class="hero-heading">About <em>KIPROD</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        The institutional identity behind an integrated credit risk ecosystem—governance visibility, capability
        development, operational strengthening, and portfolio resilience.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/#ecosystem" class="btn-primary">Our Ecosystem →</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary">Start Institutional Discussion →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-tag reveal">Institutional identity</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Operating infrastructure for <em>financial institutions</em></h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        KIPROD is not a consultancy brochure or training company. We are institutional operating infrastructure—helping
        banks, SACCOs, microfinance institutions, and fintech lenders strengthen credit risk governance and execution
        across the lending lifecycle.
      </p>

      <div class="about-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mini-panel" style="background: var(--cream)">
            <div class="mini-title">Vision</div>
            <div class="mini-note">
              To be a leading partner in strengthening credit risk management systems across financial institutions,
              enabling resilient lending and sustainable portfolio performance.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="height: 14px"></div>
          <div class="mini-panel" style="background: var(--cream)">
            <div class="mini-title">Mission</div>
            <div class="mini-note">
              To support financial institutions in building strong credit risk management systems through practical
              capability development, structured frameworks, and ongoing institutional partnership.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mini-panel" style="background: var(--cream)">
            <div class="mini-title">The challenge</div>
            <div class="mini-note">
              Credit risk challenges rarely arise from a lack of policy or technical knowledge. They arise where:
            </div>
            <ul class="bullets">
              <li><span class="dot"></span>Systems are not clearly defined</li>
              <li><span class="dot"></span>Monitoring is inconsistent</li>
              <li><span class="dot"></span>Decisions are not structured</li>
              <li><span class="dot"></span>Recovery processes are delayed</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-wrap reveal" aria-label="KIPROD brand architecture" style="margin-top: 24px">
        <svg class="arch-svg" viewBox="0 0 920 260" role="img" aria-label="KIPROD with three integrated components">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="archStrokeAbout" x1="0" x2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#C4882A" stop-opacity="0.85" />
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#E8B455" stop-opacity="0.85" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <rect x="310" y="20" width="300" height="70" rx="6" fill="#09224A" />
          <text
            x="460"
            y="55"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="DM Sans, Arial, sans-serif"
            font-size="18"
            fill="#FFFFFF"
            font-weight="600"
          >
            KIPROD
          </text>
          <text
            x="460"
            y="76"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="DM Mono, Arial, monospace"
            font-size="10"
            fill="#E8B455"
            letter-spacing="2"
          >
            ONE ECOSYSTEM
          </text>

          <path d="M460 90 V120" stroke="url(#archStrokeAbout)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path
            d="M210 120 H710"
            stroke="url(#archStrokeAbout)"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-dasharray="6 6"
          />
          <path d="M210 120 V140" stroke="url(#archStrokeAbout)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="M460 120 V140" stroke="url(#archStrokeAbout)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="M710 120 V140" stroke="url(#archStrokeAbout)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" />

          <rect x="70" y="140" width="280" height="90" rx="6" fill="#F7F4EE" stroke="#C4882A" stroke-opacity="0.35" />
          <text
            x="210"
            y="175"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="Cormorant Garamond, Georgia, serif"
            font-size="20"
            fill="#09224A"
            font-weight="600"
          >
            Credit Risk Institute
          </text>
          <text
            x="210"
            y="202"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="DM Sans, Arial, sans-serif"
            font-size="12"
            fill="#64748B"
          >
            Insight • Research • Briefs
          </text>

          <rect x="320" y="140" width="280" height="90" rx="6" fill="#F7F4EE" stroke="#C4882A" stroke-opacity="0.35" />
          <text
            x="460"
            y="175"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="Cormorant Garamond, Georgia, serif"
            font-size="20"
            fill="#09224A"
            font-weight="600"
          >
            Risk Management Academy
          </text>
          <text
            x="460"
            y="202"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="DM Sans, Arial, sans-serif"
            font-size="12"
            fill="#64748B"
          >
            Capability • Intelligence • Platform
          </text>

          <rect x="570" y="140" width="280" height="90" rx="6" fill="#F7F4EE" stroke="#C4882A" stroke-opacity="0.35" />
          <text
            x="710"
            y="175"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="Cormorant Garamond, Georgia, serif"
            font-size="20"
            fill="#09224A"
            font-weight="600"
          >
            RMS Partnerships
          </text>
          <text
            x="710"
            y="202"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="DM Sans, Arial, sans-serif"
            font-size="12"
            fill="#64748B"
          >
            Operational Strengthening • Support
          </text>
        </svg>
        <div class="arch-caption">
          KIPROD operates as one integrated ecosystem: Institute (insight), Academy (capability), RMS Partnerships
          (operational strengthening). From Insight → Capability → Execution.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="institutional">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-tag reveal">Core values</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Corporate, practical, and execution-focused.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        The tone is corporate and professional, with a modern and approachable feel—clear, practical, and easy to
        understand.
      </p>

      <div class="arms-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin-top: 50px">
        <div class="arm-card reveal" style="padding: 38px 32px">
          <div class="arm-tag">01</div>
          <div class="arm-name" style="font-size: 1.2rem">Integrity in decision-making</div>
          <div class="arm-desc">We do what is right, ensuring our work supports sound credit practices and responsible lending.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="arm-card reveal" style="padding: 38px 32px">
          <div class="arm-tag">02</div>
          <div class="arm-name" style="font-size: 1.2rem">Execution excellence</div>
          <div class="arm-desc">We deliver practical, structured, and effective solutions that work in real institutional environments.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="arm-card reveal" style="padding: 38px 32px">
          <div class="arm-tag">03</div>
          <div class="arm-name" style="font-size: 1.2rem">Professional respect</div>
          <div class="arm-desc">We engage institutional partners and stakeholders with respect, working collaboratively to strengthen outcomes.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="arm-card reveal" style="padding: 38px 32px">
          <div class="arm-tag">04</div>
          <div class="arm-name" style="font-size: 1.2rem">Practical impact</div>
          <div class="arm-desc">We measure success by improvement in credit risk systems and portfolio performance.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="arm-card reveal" style="padding: 38px 32px">
          <div class="arm-tag">05</div>
          <div class="arm-name" style="font-size: 1.2rem">Partnership mindset</div>
          <div class="arm-desc">We work with institutions as long-term partners, supporting continuous strengthening.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="arm-card reveal" style="padding: 38px 32px">
          <div class="arm-tag">06</div>
          <div class="arm-name" style="font-size: 1.2rem">One ecosystem</div>
          <div class="arm-desc">Institute (insight), Academy (capability), RMS Partnerships (operational strengthening)—one integrated ecosystem.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about" style="padding-top: 70px; padding-bottom: 70px">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-tag reveal">Next</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Start with <em>capability</em></h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        The simplest entry into the KIPROD ecosystem is through the Academy capability platform—build shared language,
        then progress into operational strengthening.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 18px" class="reveal">
        <a class="nav-cta" href="/academy" style="text-decoration: none">Explore the Academy →</a>
        <span style="display:inline-block; width: 10px"></span>
        <a href="/" class="arm-link">Back to Homepage →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

